   immediately when its condition disappears, so a recovered cgroup does not
   continue reclaiming until the next user-space event.  .. lzx-note
 
+``vm.tier2_wss_strengthen_enabled``
+  Independent APPLY switch for the WSS ``STRENGTHEN`` action, 0 or 1.  It
+  defaults to 0.  With the switch off, prediction still records an accepted
+  ``STRENGTHEN`` in ``workingset_policy_action`` and its counters, while the
+  effective action is clamped to ``NORMAL`` and cannot raise the proactive
+  reclaim watermark.  Enable it only after the future-cold page selector has
+  demonstrated useful effective-tier or reclaim-bin coverage.  .. lzx-note
+
 Cgroup v2 files
 ===============
 
